      "stage": "小学高段（5-6年级）",
      "stage_key": "x3",
      "domain": "数与代数",
      "topic": "数与运算",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "能进行简单的小数、分数四则运算和混合运算，感悟运算的一致性，发展运算能力和推理意识。",
      "source_page": 24,
      "source_pdf_page": 31,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-math"
    },
    {
      "uid": "ma-x3-con-7fe383a0",
      "seq": 29,
      "subject": "数学",
      "subject_key": "math",
      "stage": "小学高段（5-6年级）",
      "stage_key": "x3",
      "domain": "数与代数",
      "topic": "数量关系",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "根据具体情境理解等式的基本性质（例17)。",
      "source_page": 24,
      "source_pdf_page": 31,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-math"
    },
    {
      "uid": "ma-x3-con-8d51f263",
      "seq": 30,
      "subject": "数学",
      "subject_key": "math",
      "stage": "小学高段（5-6年级）",
      "stage_key": "x3",
      "domain": "数与代数",
      "topic": "数量关系",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "在解决实际问题的过程中，会选择合适的方法进行估算（例18)。",
      "source_page": 24,
      "source_pdf_page": 31,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-math"
    },
    {
      "uid": "ma-x3-con-f1885a0d",
      "seq": 32,
      "subject": "数学",
      "subject_key": "math",
      "stage": "小学高段（5-6年级）",
      "stage_key": "x3",
      "domain": "数与代数",
      "topic": "数量关系",
      "type": "content",
      "text": "在实际情境中理解比和比例以及按比例分配的含义，能解决简单的问题。",
      "source_page": 24,
      "source_pdf_page": 31,
      "source_id": "moe-cn-2022-math"
    },
    {
      "uid": "ma-x3-con-15640338",
